          "suggested_revision": "Replace the out-of-unit references with a description of the actual color-change condition. Keep the rock/gate relationship and shared support. Review the replacement before accepting it.",
          "severity": "major"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "οὐ γὰρ ἦσαν ὑπὸ τῶν παρθένων ἐπιδεδομένοι, οὐδὲ διὰ τῆς πύλης παρενηνεγμένοι.",
          "english_quote": "Retain rock/gate distinctions, shared carrying, stone counts, the explicitly conjectural negative and the distinction between a pause and completion; preserve all substantive alternative notes.",
